nginx-guide 1.0
=================
Covered NGINX version: 1.27.x (latest stable as of mid-2026)
OpenSSL: >= 1.1.1 (TLSv1.3, OCSP Stapling, Early Data)
HTTP/3 (QUIC): requires NGINX >= 1.25.0 with --with-http_v3_module
njs: 0.8.x
ACME: 1.27.x built-in

This guide was extracted from the official nginx.org documentation
(~150 HTML files, ~96K lines) and condensed into 28 reference files
(~14.6K lines) plus a growing examples/ directory with real-world
scenarios.

For details on what changed between versions, see:
https://nginx.org/en/CHANGES
